      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "With two wrong entries, repair both.\n\nExample: recorded mean 40.2 for 10 values. One entry is 18 too high, and another was written 13 instead of 33.\nThe first correction is −18; the second is +20.\nNet correction = +2 to the total.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
